# LOG_054: Purpose Over Technology

**Date:** 2026-08-06
**Source:** Field Observation - Problem Solving
**Tags:** #Purpose #Friction #Tools #VaultPrinciple

## Observation
Ignore the tool. Ask: What problem does this infrastructure solve? Technology changes. Needs remain.

## Pattern
Every technology survives only if it removes friction.

## Vault Principle
**Understand the need before studying the tool.**

## Leverage
Start every project with: "What friction dies here?" Then pick the tool.

